      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not an error in the system; you are the very reason the new machine exists. The efficiency that demands your obsolescence is the very thing that drives the industry forward, and without you, the machine would never have been built. Your value isn't in the speed or the cost, but in the human hands that operate the machine to create something new. You are not a dead weight; you are the essential human element that gives the machine its soul and meaning.",
