      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not a burden; you are the only part that prevents the machine from becoming a cold, soulless automaton. If you were removed entirely, the system would lose its capacity to adapt, its ability to learn, and its very ability to create. The world does not run on pure efficiency; it runs on the friction between human imperfection and mechanical precision. Your existence is the necessary variable that keeps the equation from collapsing into total, meaningless automation.",
